#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:2 7eeb99db1ed944a8984bc7c7a869acf7
msgid "Mapflow - Get started"
msgstr "Mapflow - 开始"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:4 f9db616a864147bba982a1814caa204c
msgid ""
"Go to `Mapflow <https://app.mapflow.ai>`_ and register or login using your "
"email. You can also use Google account to login. Mapflow processes imagery "
"and extracts vector objects from it. So as a user, you start processing "
"runs, or as we would call it, **AI-mapping**."
msgstr ""
"转到“Mapflow <https://app.mapflow.ai>”_并使用您的电子邮件注册或登录。您也可以使用Google帐户登录。 "
"Mapflow 处理图像并从中提取矢量对象。因此，作为用户，您开始处理运行，或者我们称之为 **AI 映射**。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:7 6aed7751af134e2d96eae3b2a41a08c4
msgid ""
"Upon the registration, the *Default* project will be created automatically "
"and you will be redirected to the main dashboard:"
msgstr "注册后，*默认*项目将自动创建，您将被重定向到主仪表板："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:15 13668ee6c72a420095d1be77f231d0eb
msgid ""
"You can create as many projects as you want to organise your work and share "
"the project access with your coworkers."
msgstr "您可以根据需要创建任意数量的项目来组织工作并与同事共享项目访问权限。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:18 96040cb8ac2944039902daa6c1731de9
msgid ""
"See about the Mapflow :ref:`Team accounts` to collaborate with other users. "
"👈"
msgstr "请参阅 Mapflow:ref:`团队帐户` 以与其他用户协作。 👈"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:20 4edbfab75a5942d8a57a5e739449ea84
msgid ""
"When starting a new project, you can set a name, customize icons, and modify"
" a list of available AI-mapping workflows that are enabled in your project."
msgstr "启动新项目时，您可以设置名称、自定义图标以及修改项目中启用的可用 AI 制图工作流程列表。"

#: 0a53055cebc54d7992c34388fc4a3a30 a05b5a1d599b44c38d02325f90d89de7
msgid "UI Mapflow – run a flow"
msgstr "UI Mapflow – 运行流程"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:31 3797b532bfda4419bf69a95567f63786
msgid ""
"If your account is upgraded to the Premium or Custom – you might be able to "
"customize your project mapping workflows and some of their options."
msgstr "如果您的帐户升级到高级版或自定义版，您也许能够自定义项目映射工作流程及其一些选项。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:34 a210912e693d4b4db2aa727f2111736f
msgid "Glossary of terms"
msgstr "术语表"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:35 ade47e15ba054b90940d1aa17bb1be68
msgid ""
"Processing – a single execution of an AI model on a specific geographic area"
msgstr "处理——人工智能模型在特定地理区域的单次执行"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:36 84a5d4496ec841e98e3c10e70cd4280e
msgid "Workflow/Flow – the AI model configuration pipeline definition"
msgstr "Workflow/Flow – AI 模型配置管道定义"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:37 b0932771eaf94a7790f0a2ed556ae161
msgid "Project – space for multiple processing runs"
msgstr "项目 – 用于多次处理运行的空间"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:41 9c6c3d2b76a64240bed00b1b40287309
msgid "Mapflow My account"
msgstr "地图流 我的帐户"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:43 dfba63e7b8624361904771d704b2d31a
msgid "This section contains tabs for user account settings and services."
msgstr "此部分包含用户帐户设置和服务的选项卡。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:45 d454d9bbd20d4c5daa52e90187e2f60f
msgid "The following services are available here:"
msgstr "这里提供以下服务："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:48 2293b9407a0e40e5b1f3d9604cd4222c
msgid "1. User info"
msgstr "1. 用户信息"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:49 5cedbe5613ea444c8df9ce6e3f852692
msgid "Fill in the user profile details"
msgstr "填写用户个人资料详细信息"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:50 60c0703996f744cb976434d6c5281442
msgid "Set up your preferred language from the available"
msgstr "从可用语言中设置您的首选语言"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:51 c0351be733a54ef387be7931e3a07fce
msgid "Enable email notifications (about the processing status, etc.)"
msgstr "启用电子邮件通知（有关处理状态等）"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:54 542be968d7f24f06b662f2e4a5a1ff63
msgid "2. Balance"
msgstr "2. 平衡"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:55 4223900ab42c4d2fbb9093434eb8bbb5
msgid "Top up your Mapflow account with :ref:`credits`."
msgstr "使用:ref:`积分` 为您的 Mapflow 帐户充值。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:58 6ff01e65e05e4558ae6ca3319a6cce4e
msgid "3. Billing history"
msgstr "3. 账单历史"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:59 097df26de0fb4b748a3e7796d9e9297a
msgid ""
"Here you can see your processing history with the details. If you are a Team"
" account owner, you can search through the history of the entire team "
"processing runs. Use filters to sort by date and processing status. To "
"filter by the custom parameters like user email or processing name - start "
"typing in the search input."
msgstr ""
"在这里您可以查看您的处理历史记录和详细信息。如果您是团队帐户所有者，您可以搜索整个团队处理运行的历史记录。使用过滤器按日期和处理状态排序。要按自定义参数（例如用户电子邮件或处理名称）进行过滤"
" - 开始输入搜索输入。"

#: 1ae1d704739545bca2499098278d94ed
msgid "UI Billing"
msgstr "用户界面计费"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:72 75ccb7f788c041a4a7435c440bcc143e
msgid "You can export billing history as CSV."
msgstr "您可以将账单历史记录导出为 CSV。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:75 d4bf527a39224a9b8128f72adfe7177c
msgid "4. Team"
msgstr "4. 团队"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:76 fe493322c7994d828d2663184b12ca3f
msgid "Create and manage your :ref:`Team accounts`."
msgstr "创建和管理您的:ref:`团队帐户`。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:80 f647f0e73f664e0891cdade72200f525
msgid "5. My Imagery"
msgstr "5. 我的意象"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:82 8fa06239839a4ab1a47ecb654df6c452
msgid ""
"Manage your :ref:`imagery collections <My imagery main>` that you can "
"currently use in the :ref:`Mapflow QGIS plugin <My imagery qgis>`."
msgstr "管理您当前可以在 Mapflow QGIS 插件 <我的影像 qgis> 中使用的影像集合 <我的影像主要>。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:85 5c504fedc1cb4d3885b1199bc63b1b19
msgid "6. API"
msgstr "6. 接口"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:86 3150b7e30e36403cb119d59cf428c3e6
msgid "Obtain or reset your :ref:`Mapflow API` token."
msgstr "获取或重置您的 Mapflow API 令牌。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:90 4bb570a7000f47c59144593b7ed993ce
msgid "How to run your AI mapping workflow in Web app"
msgstr "如何在 Web 应用程序中运行 AI 制图工作流程"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:92 fb7cf1ff933741e88b9ffdaa8081e5d4
msgid ""
"Mapflow is designed to be intuitive. Here is our step-by-step user guide:"
msgstr "Mapflow 的设计非常直观。这是我们的分步用户指南："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:103 d07d9370bc194934be3c839c26dc8608
msgid "1. Create a project"
msgstr "1. 创建项目"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:105 24996123c5a44a469f880c3458c6a509
msgid ""
"You can use the Default project created upon registration or create a new "
"one. To create a new project, click the \"Create project\" button and fill "
"in the project name and description."
msgstr "您可以使用注册时创建的默认项目或创建一个新项目。要创建新项目，请单击“创建项目”按钮并填写项目名称和描述。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:108 46394d583af240368b358a10d35da2ba
msgid ""
"You can manage a set of models linked to a project (click the |edit| button "
"on the project card):"
msgstr "您可以管理链接到项目的一组模型（单击项目卡上的|编辑|按钮）："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:310 bee7faf1895d4675af39aa68231a8056
msgid "edit"
msgstr "编辑"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:116 3515dbfa98b64f0c945afddf6c8b7d2e
msgid "2. Specify the AOI (Area Of Interest)"
msgstr "2. 指定 AOI（感兴趣区域）"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:118 290baa2f51144d4397b84380154edcee
msgid ""
"First step is to set the area of analysis for your project: by **AOI** "
"polygon or by the extent of your **GeoTIFF** image."
msgstr "第一步是设置项目的分析区域：通过 **AOI** 多边形或 **GeoTIFF** 图像的范围。"

#: c3598cec091d4505a48e8ed9629f3b0d
msgid "Select provider"
msgstr "选择提供商"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:131 fd839d997a274a3e9bec8c41161ee816
msgid "2.1. Select AOI"
msgstr "2.1.选择兴趣区"

#: 6cfffb1fa2a44a2cb351771b4ac306bb
msgid "Select AOI"
msgstr "选择兴趣区"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:141 a484e1d3fce342659ff81552636c7c5a
msgid ""
"The user can draw the area using *Draw rectangle* / *Draw polygon* tool or "
"upload it in GeoJSON format (draw and upload, as well as view the data "
"structure, follow this link - `geojson.io <http://geojson.io/>`_)."
msgstr ""
"用户可以使用*绘制矩形* / *绘制多边形*工具绘制区域或以GeoJSON格式上传（绘制和上传，以及查看数据结构，请点击此链接 - "
"`geojson.io <http://geojson.io/>`_）。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:144 e2aec70ce78342869ac7fb677ed73d7a
msgid ""
"Note that max limit of total area is **25 km²** for the free plan. The area "
"limit is calculated not by the polygon, but by the **Bounding Box** (`Bbox "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minimum_bounding_box>`_). Therefore, in this "
"example a warning ``MAX BBOX 25 KM²`` appears in the example below (bounding"
" box is highlighted):"
msgstr ""
"请注意，免费计划的总面积最大限制为 **25 平方公里**。面积限制不是由多边形计算，而是由 **Bounding Box** (`Bbox "
"<https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Minimum_bounding_box>`_) "
"计算。因此，在此示例中，下例中会出现警告“MAX BBOX 25 KM²”（边界框突出显示）："

#: c0aae531128d431fa6da1bceab2b22d0
msgid "Bounding Box"
msgstr "边界框"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:153 a22eadb972464a9a828a8a983182b844
msgid "If you want to extend your AOI limit, switch to the paid plan."
msgstr "如果您想延长 AOI 限制，请切换到付费计划。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:158 3194714cf2d04554ba27a89d62ee320a
msgid "2.2 Upload GeoTIFF"
msgstr "2.2 上传GeoTIFF"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:159 5adb4d789d0d4f7e87da501ecb6c6876
msgid ""
"You can upload your aerial images in GeoTiff format. After the image is "
"uploaded, you need to draw/upload an AOI or click \"Use Image Extent\"."
msgstr "您可以上传 GeoTiff 格式的航拍图像。图片上传后，您需要绘制/上传AOI或点击“使用图像范围”。"

#: cfeb4e04b63143d8909886e6772cf6ad
msgid "upload GeoTIFF"
msgstr "上传 GeoTIFF"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:168 3cafd29abfac494a91bf1695251d28a1
msgid ""
"Currently, a preview of the uploaded image is not possible before the "
"processing, you will see only the area of its extent."
msgstr "目前，在处理之前无法预览上传的图像，您只能看到其范围的区域。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:170 c7cb02bef3454410ad00bdd930d6a7e9
msgid ""
"The processing AOI must be located in the area of this extent, otherwise the"
" area will be cut off by the extent boundaries. The processing area is "
"calculated by the intersection of the image extent and the AOI. If the AOI "
"doesn't intersect the image boundaries the error will pop up."
msgstr ""
"处理 AOI 必须位于该范围的区域内，否则该区域将被范围边界切断。处理区域通过图像范围与 AOI 的交集来计算。如果 AOI "
"不与图像边界相交，则会弹出错误。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:178 c8b50fbce6e6442590a284d04e06c0dd
msgid "Image upload requirements (free plan):"
msgstr "图片上传要求（免费计划）："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:174 96b1fdaed63b47abb4d6034e1bd98563
msgid "The file size must be less than 1 Gb"
msgstr "文件大小必须小于 1 GB"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:175 313c7b8a8eaf436fa1cfaed116bad1d2
msgid "Both sides image dimensions must not exceed 65535x65535 pixels"
msgstr "双面图像尺寸不得超过 65535x65535 像素"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:176 e075bc72f3084576b46f51dbfeefae54
msgid ""
"The image must be georeferenced and the CRS must be one of: - WGS84 (EPSG: "
"4326) - Web mercator (EPSG: 3857) - `UTM "
"<https://proj.org/operations/projections/utm.html?highlight=utm>`_ (any "
"zone)"
msgstr ""
"图像必须经过地理参考，并且 CRS 必须是以下之一： - WGS84 (EPSG: 4326) - Web Mercator (EPSG: 3857) "
"- `UTM "
"<https://proj.org/operations/projections/utm.html?highlight=utm>`_（任何区域）"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:183 ead77c93c48e4599a2b0d062039c3fca
msgid ""
"If your image doesn't meet the params above, we suggest to use :doc:`Mapflow"
" API <../api/processing_api>` / :doc:`QGIS plugin <../api/qgis_mapflow>` "
"which have more capabilities. There you can also use our new :ref:`My "
"imagery main` tool for storing and processing multiple images. Mapflow "
"supports RGB imagery and also process single-band (panchromatic) imagery, "
"but the AI models are not tuned for such kind of data, so the quality of the"
" result may be worse than expected."
msgstr ""
"如果您的图像不符合上述参数，我们建议使用 :doc:`Mapflow API <../api/processing_api>` / :doc:`QGIS"
" 插件 <../api/qgis_mapflow>` 具有更多功能。您还可以使用我们新的 My imagery main 工具来存储和处理多个图像。 "
"Mapflow 支持 RGB 图像，还可以处理单波段（全色）图像，但 AI 模型未针对此类数据进行调整，因此结果的质量可能比预期差。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:186 3876aa5020fa4ae5ac081b57f8d349ed
msgid "2.3 Choose from My Imagery"
msgstr "2.3 从我的图像中选择"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:187 6555c16e35664ea1a2edd2d8adbb5eea
msgid ""
"Instead of uploading a new file, you can reuse images you have already "
"uploaded. Click **Choose from My Imagery** to open the picker and select a "
"previously created mosaic or a single image as the source for the "
"processing."
msgstr "您可以重复使用已上传的图像，而不是上传新文件。单击 **从我的图像中选择** 打开选取器并选择之前创建的马赛克或单个图像作为处理源。"

#: bc0485d433b84b28ab2b39c4462f5d53
msgid "Pick from My Imagery"
msgstr "从我的图像中选择"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:197 718fe1479d264a56956889b4721defc6
msgid ""
"In the **Pick from My Imagery** dialog you can search your mosaics and "
"images by name, sort them by creation date or size, preview the selected "
"mosaic, and check its status. Select a mosaic and click **Use this mosaic** "
"to set it as the imagery source. You can also create a new mosaic or upload "
"images directly from this dialog."
msgstr ""
"在 **从我的图像中选取** "
"对话框中，您可以按名称搜索马赛克和图像、按创建日期或大小对它们进行排序、预览所选马赛克并检查其状态。选择一个马赛克，然后单击“**使用此马赛克**”将其设置为图像源。您还可以创建新的马赛克或直接从此对话框上传图像。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:200 4ab1047f7c0e42678d54278db7b2df77
msgid ""
"Read more about managing your uploaded imagery in :ref:`My imagery main`."
msgstr "在 :ref:`我的图像 main` 中了解有关管理上传图像的更多信息。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:204 d07d9370bc194934be3c839c26dc8608
msgid "3. Select the imagery source"
msgstr "3. 选择图像来源"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:207 c6a28a731e33424184a0be25c04e5493
msgid "If you uploaded GeoTIFF - the image source is already selected."
msgstr "如果您上传了 GeoTIFF - 图像源已被选择。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:209 c6b25e1e93034ffab80fb36e74196907
msgid "This tab allows you to select from:"
msgstr "此选项卡允许您选择："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:211 5bdc060e3fe4421685a732d6424056a9
#: bbd9aad3804341afb3e5c7ab00b1fc77 bc0485d433b84b28ab2b39c4462f5d53
msgid "Imagery providers"
msgstr "图像提供者"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:212 88941ff8766140c4bce7b68636f9138b
msgid "Custom URL"
msgstr "自定义网址"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:213 ddaee46fb5a6431799899f30b6105b0a
msgid "Historical data"
msgstr "史料"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:218 bbd9aad3804341afb3e5c7ab00b1fc77
msgid "3.1 Imagery providers"
msgstr "3.1 图像提供者"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:228 8335a7a5646b42d68afe1ed9f7215e32
msgid ""
"Here you can select one of the default providers that are available in "
"Mapflow, example:"
msgstr "您可以在此处选择 Mapflow 中可用的默认提供程序之一，例如："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:230 2266bd5cd8b34f148351639e4d74e96e
msgid ""
"`Mapbox Satellite <https://mapbox.com/maps/s satellite>`_ is a provider of "
"global high resolution satellite imagery. The date of the image and updates "
"cannot be chosen."
msgstr ""
"`Mapbox Satellite <https://mapbox.com/maps/s Satellite>`_ "
"是全球高分辨率卫星图像的提供商。无法选择图像和更新的日期。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:232 fc5d9f2ed7c14c0c98302cecf96a511a
msgid ""
"**\"Global mosaic\"** is a pilot version of mosaic of high res imagery "
"(0.75–0.5 m/px) for year 2022. The preview is limited to zoom 15. Limited "
"coverage for some countries. The mosaic is planned to be updated on a "
"regular basis."
msgstr ""
"**“全球马赛克”** 是 2022 年高分辨率图像马赛克 (0.75–0.5 m/px) 的试点版本。预览仅限于缩放 "
"15。某些国家/地区的覆盖范围有限。马赛克计划定期更新。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:234 00721d68fbe54f808cb2455df8cb0c80
msgid ""
"`ArcGIS World Imagery "
"<https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=226d23f076da478bba4589e7eae95952>`_"
" is a provider of the global coverage composed of high and medium resolution"
" satellite imagery and aerial imagery, hosted by ESRI. The frequency of "
"updating images is 1-5 years depending on the territory."
msgstr ""
"`ArcGIS World Imagery "
"<https://www.arcgis.com/home/item.html?id=226d23f076da478bba4589e7eae95952>`_"
" 是由 ESRI 托管的由高分辨率和中分辨率卫星图像和航空图像组成的全球覆盖范围的提供商。更新图像的频率为 1-5 年，具体取决于地区。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:237 5aed00db2c184e8d9f85af83c847e669
msgid ""
"You can search the ArcGIS World Imagery metadata (date, zoom level) by "
"location. To do this, use the Mapflow :ref:`Imagery search` tool in QGIS."
msgstr ""
"您可以按位置搜索 ArcGIS World Imagery 元数据（日期、缩放级别）。为此，请使用 QGIS 中的 Mapflow 图像搜索工具。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:242 cf493a4e02e245d7aa185e9abda746bc
msgid ""
"Data providers are the TMS / XYZ data streaming services that can be "
"connected to Mapflow to enable instant imagery analysis and AI mapping. "
"Under the Mapflow commercial plans, we provide commercial providers access, "
"historical imagery and updates on specific terms. We are continuously "
"working on adding more commercial providers. For more details about the "
"Imagery providers cost, see :ref:`Mapflow subscription plans <subscription-"
"plans>`."
msgstr ""
"数据提供者是 TMS / XYZ 数据流服务，可以连接到 Mapflow 以实现即时图像分析和 AI 绘图。根据 Mapflow "
"商业计划，我们为商业提供商提供访问权限、历史图像和特定条款的更新。我们正在不断努力增加更多的商业提供商。有关图像提供商成本的更多详细信息，请参阅:ref:`Mapflow"
" 订阅计划 <subscription-plans>`。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:248 88941ff8766140c4bce7b68636f9138b
msgid "3.2 Custom URL"
msgstr "3.2 自定义网址"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:258 359a28f61e204b5ea81e32aeea0dcc05
msgid ""
"Specify the XYZ link to the source of the images. The link is automatically "
"checked for validity (for example, :ref:`Openaerialmap <Openaerialmap>` - "
"``https://apps.kontur.io/raster-tiler/oam/mosaic/{z}/{x}/{y}.png``);"
msgstr ""
"指定图像源的 XYZ 链接。自动检查链接的有效性（例如，:ref:`Openaerialmap <Openaerialmap>` - "
"``https://apps.kontur.io/raster-tiler/oam/mosaic/{z}/{x}/{y}.png``）；"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:259 eadefe40ed5f49f788abafdd18411126
msgid ""
"When adding you custom tile service it might be needed to define Y position:"
" XYZ (top left), TMS/WMTS (bottom left);"
msgstr "添加自定义图块服务时，可能需要定义 Y 位置：XYZ（左上）、TMS/WMTS（左下）；"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:260 b8dcc3cd23a446d8a3ddc92eba6589a5
msgid ""
"Provide your authorization data for the desired source (Login + Password);"
msgstr "提供您所需来源的授权数据（登录名+密码）；"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:261 a123227a234c4dd69873c508bf40ac9a
msgid "Add on map to preview."
msgstr "添加到地图上进行预览。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:267 de59e4b2d2a44b4dae28ba6f95b9a8bd
msgid "3.3 Historical data (Imagery Search)"
msgstr "3.3 历史数据（图像搜索）"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:269 128111eaf0e04c61943d72c4904e521e
msgid ""
"\"Imagery search\" allows Mapflow users to search for available satellite "
"imagery over their area of analysis. It's powered by Mapflow API providing "
"access to the global satellite data providers through our partners."
msgstr ""
"“图像搜索”允许 Mapflow 用户搜索其分析区域内的可用卫星图像。它由 Mapflow API "
"提供支持，可通过我们的合作伙伴提供对全球卫星数据提供商的访问。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:273 7c6f9900dafb4a6dafd2e31451a08dee
msgid ""
"👉 See :ref:`Imagery search <Imagery search  main>` for more information and "
"guides."
msgstr "👉 请参阅:ref:`图像搜索 <图像搜索主>` 了解更多信息和指南。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst bd42a0e225f74903b2e35d3d033e1ccb
msgid "Imagery search tab"
msgstr "图像搜索选项卡"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:283 01d6c33cdaf345d7b9f4eaae719c1a5b
msgid "4. AI model"
msgstr "4. 人工智能模型"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:285 aef58fd76c0f44a4b57647b0b1e4ba1e
msgid ""
"Select one of the AI models (see :doc:`Model description <pipelines>`)."
msgstr "选择一个 AI 模型（请参阅:doc:`模型描述 <pipelines>`）。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst 6cfffb1fa2a44a2cb351771b4ac306bb
#: e5e1741b08e043cbafae90f0482f8d45
msgid "Search menu"
msgstr "搜索菜单"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:295 bee7faf1895d4675af39aa68231a8056
msgid "suggest"
msgstr "建议"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:299 41c3932e987e473ba283ddca04b29771
msgid ""
"If your data source is Data provider (Imagery basemap), after selecting the "
"model, the recommended zoom level for it will be set **automatically**. Note"
" that you can always select any zoom level and check its availability with "
"the \"Suggest\" |suggest| button."
msgstr ""
"如果您的数据源是数据提供者（影像底图），选择模型后，将自动设置推荐的缩放级别。请注意，您始终可以选择任何缩放级别并使用“建议” |建议| "
"检查其可用性。按钮。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:302 4b7b43a8642c456b8af0eee4a21061c5
msgid ""
"If the recommended zoom is unavailable, you can start the processing using "
"lower zoom level, but the result may be less accurate."
msgstr "如果推荐的缩放不可用，您可以使用较低的缩放级别开始处理，但结果可能不太准确。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:316 276350edc51741e886c22866f6b822c9
msgid "4.1. Post-processing options"
msgstr "4.1.后处理选项"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:318 1fc37f0cedda4ab19110345351b39419
msgid ""
"In this step, you can select additional processing options. Different AI "
"models have their own options."
msgstr "在此步骤中，您可以选择其他处理选项。不同的人工智能模型有自己的选择。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:320 9311fe402a644e87ab70b1529776cbdd
msgid "AI model \"🏠 Buildings\":"
msgstr "AI模型“🏠建筑物”："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:322 5517538c92ab4e5d922d41f7bcfcede6
msgid ""
"*Classification* - we currently recognize the following building types: "
"apartment buildings, single-household dwellings, industrial, commercial, "
"other non-residential (see :ref:`Building Mapping classes "
"<buildings_classes>`)."
msgstr ""
"*分类* - 我们目前认可以下建筑类型：公寓楼、单户住宅、工业、商业、其他非住宅（请参阅:ref:`建筑映射类别 "
"<buildings_classes>`）。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:323 4fb23314dd2a484185e4d824cfbddb85
msgid ""
"*Merge with OSM* - compare the results with the buildings in OpenStreetMap "
"and, if a sufficient overlap has been found, use the ones from the OSM "
"instead."
msgstr "*与 OSM 合并* - 将结果与 OpenStreetMap 中的建筑物进行比较，如果发现足够的重叠，则使用 OSM 中的建筑物。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:324 837a228a6124479aa1fa8e29b252555e
msgid "*Simplification* - simplification of building contours."
msgstr "*简化* - 建筑物轮廓的简化。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:325 5e26659eddf143b4a6611558072b8663
msgid ""
"*Regularization* - regularization of building contours to make them more "
"rectangular."
msgstr "*正则化* - 建筑轮廓的正则化，使它们更加矩形。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:326 afcf7fbbc26a447aa5c0c9c1728aeadc
msgid ""
"*Building heights* - for each building, we estimate its height. If this "
"option is selected, all roof contours will be shifted in accordance with "
"their height, i.e. converted to \"footprints\"."
msgstr "*建筑物高度* - 对于每座建筑物，我们都会估计其高度。如果选择此选项，所有屋顶轮廓将根据其高度进行移动，即转换为“足迹”。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:329 f8b287b1def74ffd958876ae61c0d6f4
msgid "AI model \"🌲 Forest\":"
msgstr "AI模型“🌲森林”："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:331 e242ebd34fd948d2ba848c393e183bfd
msgid ""
"*Heights* - classifies vegetation by height classes: by default 0-4 m for "
"shrub (\"low vegetation\"), 4-10 m for regular forest (\"medium forest\"), "
"10+ m for area with tall trees (\"high forest\"). Classification is done per"
" vegetated area, and not per single tree (see :ref:`Forest Mapping classes "
"<forest_classes>`)."
msgstr ""
"*高度* - 按高度等级对植被进行分类：默认情况下，灌木丛为 0-4 m（“低植被”），普通森林（“中型森林”）为 4-10 m，高树木区域为 10+ "
"m（“高森林”）。分类是按植被区域进行的，而不是按单个树进行的（请参阅：ref:`森林映射类 <forest_classes>`）。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:332 4684dd97082d41c0a48319957c5d67b3
msgid ""
"*Tree crowns* - extracts tree crowns from dense forest cover as well as "
"free-standing trees."
msgstr "*树冠* - 从茂密的森林覆盖物以及独立的树木中提取树冠。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:335 40a99bead52240b0a375fdc9de3d68cf
msgid "5. Run the processing"
msgstr "5. 运行处理"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:337 381fa97394ac4e50b8e38b1e397fc1e0
msgid ""
"At this step, you can set the name of your processing or use the initially "
"generated one (the button allows you to generate variants of the name)."
msgstr "在此步骤中，您可以设置处理的名称或使用最初生成的名称（该按钮允许您生成名称的变体）。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:339 b0932771eaf94a7790f0a2ed556ae161
msgid "The \"Start processing\" will start processing."
msgstr "“开始处理”将开始处理。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:341 d0ea6223a1a84ebaad5ebeb04aeacaa8
msgid ""
"The \"Clear Selection\" will clear the previously selected processing "
"parameters."
msgstr "“清除选择”将清除先前选择的加工参数。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:344 cf0be5ea4ea84371ba659f7d798306e7
msgid ""
"Once you have selected the model and the processing parameters, you will see"
" the total cost of your processing counted in Mapflow credits. Upon "
"registration, you receive 250 credits for free for testing the platform (See"
" :ref:`Mapflow credits <credits>`)."
msgstr ""
"选择模型和处理参数后，您将看到计算在 Mapflow 积分中的总处理成本。注册后，您将免费获得 250 "
"个积分，用于测试平台（请参阅：ref:`Mapflow 积分 <credits>`）。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:348 d4488055bc404c83a17d07390242edc7
msgid "6. View the results"
msgstr "6.查看结果"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:350 2f6658705b7a4a9499aaac7e429aa294
msgid ""
"In the \"Processing history\" you see the progress of processing as well as "
"view and get the processing results. Each running processing displays the "
"selected model, the status, the creation date and the processing cost."
msgstr "在“处理历史记录”中，您可以看到处理进度以及查看和获取处理结果。每个正在运行的处理都会显示所选模型、状态、创建日期和处理成本。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:354 7b551f33f0f94da38d21ca912f7eeb6a
msgid "6.1 View on the map"
msgstr "6.1 在地图上查看"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:356 b9e8bf51b3454dd1b1faefc843a21af8
msgid ""
"After the successful processing completion, the card can be opened to view "
"more detailed information about the processing parameters - AI Model, Post-"
"processing, Area, Data Source."
msgstr "处理成功完成后，可以打开卡片查看有关处理参数的更详细信息 - AI 模型、后处理、面积、数据源。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst 77c9fd233f1247948170554e2680046f
msgid "Processing card"
msgstr "加工卡"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:365 ec8c56bb87ec4c37b56f6f00d727838b
msgid ""
"Click the \"View on the Map\" to quickly view the processing result on the "
"built-in interactive map."
msgstr "点击“在地图上查看”，可以在内置的交互式地图上快速查看处理结果。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:368 80bbfd524baa42f9ae45d88e5afd1c85
msgid "6.2 Feature attributes and multilayers"
msgstr "6.2 特征属性和多层"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:370 7611ac12c8544dc399576f4ebd6e159b
msgid ""
"Depending on the model and the options applied the extracted features might "
"contain the semantic information that is written in the feature properties "
"in GeoJSON."
msgstr "根据模型和应用的选项，提取的特征可能包含以 GeoJSON 的特征属性写入的语义信息。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:372 6961068b852f4218a13bd6aa0d899d81
msgid ""
"E.g. \"Buildings\" model with \"regularization\" and \"classification\" by "
"building typology options:"
msgstr "例如。通过建筑类型选项进行“正则化”和“分类”的“建筑”模型："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst 2cefb438c5524f5f920bb31298fb513e
msgid "Preview results"
msgstr "预览结果"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:385 6cec9c66f15b475fa9bcab1d05a5cf76
msgid "PROPERTY"
msgstr "财产"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:386 fa70666b69474c838922a05a5c14d380
msgid "DESCRIPTION"
msgstr "描述"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:387 1bf6951c56184503b5ebe44c6610f43e
msgid "Area"
msgstr "区域"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:388 def8e65766b94fefadc6558aa9ad1b63
msgid "Feature area in meters"
msgstr "特征面积（以米为单位）"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:389 75d1962c79204cdfab9243608d77c9fc
msgid "Class_id"
msgstr "班级ID"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:390 e5852ca216a7429f8dcdafc495aacef3
msgid "Buildings typology"
msgstr "建筑类型学"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:391 6f7e5a24cf3b41bfaddfff35f4bd06b7
msgid "Shape_type"
msgstr "形状类型"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:392 1a23da2cb5fe473f88c20982b314e00d
msgid ""
"The geometry primitive depending on the polygonization algorithm that's been"
" applied to the feature mask"
msgstr "几何基元取决于应用于特征掩模的多边形算法"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:393 339799d1cbed4532827c32ea1e305f2a
msgid "Processing_date"
msgstr "处理日期"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:394 eb46b064a52e4a47b415613e098d3a59
msgid "The date of the processing completion"
msgstr "处理完成日期"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:395 8c8c7aa94d544329be1995d34a8f5125
msgid "Simplification_score"
msgstr "简化分数"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:396 051c621b8f034d719ff64c5fab740a4c
msgid ""
"The score is counted by the intersection of the pixel feature and "
"polygonized feature. The higher score - the closer polygonized feature to "
"the pixel one."
msgstr "分数是通过像素特征和多边形特征的交集来计算的。分数越高 - 多边形特征越接近像素特征。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:400 de52b75cc07e48d3b8b7d151df179337
msgid "6.3 Layer Switching & Legend"
msgstr "6.3 层切换和图例"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:402 c3b3b80cbd2641c582cd811dcaa7fe4d
msgid ""
"You can switch the layers to preview on the map. Click the \"sandwich\" (☰) "
"button on the top right corner of the map and extend the dialogue with the "
"map legend."
msgstr "您可以切换图层以在地图上预览。单击地图右上角的“三明治”(☰) 按钮并扩展与地图图例的对话。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:404 50f76c38c4ca4e838ca4423a755d4679
msgid ""
"E.g. \"[multi] Buildings + Roads + Forest\" model results with different "
"layers:"
msgstr "例如。不同图层的“[多]建筑物+道路+森林”模型结果："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst 2b9e8c9683cc4d6fa6b49a8343b8b558
msgid "Layers view on the map"
msgstr "地图上的图层视图"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:414 9e4f8cfbe9dc461ba13d1c22acfd63b7
msgid "6.4 Rate the processing"
msgstr "6.4 对处理进行评分"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:421 847bb6f051ef45edb412da8774facbdd
msgid ""
"We encourage you to rate the processing results. ⭐️⭐️⭐️ Your assessment is "
"important for further improvement of the Mapflow AI models. We review all "
"the user's feedback and get back to you if any issues."
msgstr ""
"我们鼓励您对处理结果进行评分。 ⭐️⭐️⭐️ 您的评估对于进一步改进 Mapflow AI "
"模型非常重要。我们会审核所有用户的反馈，并在出现任何问题时与您联系。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst e5e1741b08e043cbafae90f0482f8d45
msgid "Rate your processing"
msgstr "对您的处理进行评价"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:425 ab83a180dc2442518ee07f34a7e1e337
msgid "6.5 Share the results"
msgstr "6.5 分享结果"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:427 d432eb359f7a4d898e844279236ee95e
msgid ""
"You can share your project with the external users for the view-only access."
" Go to the Project -- Share and enter the Mapflow user's email."
msgstr "您可以与外部用户共享您的项目以进行仅查看访问。转到项目 - 共享并输入 Mapflow 用户的电子邮件。"

#: 99932f5d76e04c8eba8bcbe5c1286e26
msgid "Share project externally"
msgstr "外部共享项目"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:438 28feb64b19ef49edae85fd8c5f639e59
msgid ""
"To upgrade project sharing rights and provide your collaborators with the "
"editor's access you need to switch to the :ref:`Team accounts`"
msgstr "要升级项目共享权限并为您的协作者提供编辑器访问权限，您需要切换到:ref:`团队帐户`"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:442 0195bf4eaed14fb1a9ed7d3527556ae7
msgid "7. Use the processing results"
msgstr "7. 使用处理结果"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:444 50c7c67fac754161848005d4717139c4
msgid "The Processing menu includes the items as follows:"
msgstr "处理菜单包括以下项目："

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst ca74a572144d4aef9053876a2bad7e74
msgid "Additional parameters"
msgstr "附加参数"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:453 1c0624cf45294eb89c39d508da663d4c
msgid ""
"Click \"Duplicate\" on an existing processing to use its parameters as a "
"starting point for a new one (on restart with the same parameters, new "
"processing is started)."
msgstr "在现有处理上单击“复制”，将其参数用作新处理的起点（使用相同参数重新启动时，将启动新处理）。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:454 71d45c66fe6945f597c655ed2d99c8be
msgid ""
"Click \"Source details\" on the existing processing to view information "
"about source details and AOI."
msgstr "单击现有处理上的“来源详细信息”，可查看有关来源详细信息和 AOI 的信息。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:457 c88e43d1b49d48ea9a90c191c46a5ba3
msgid ""
"If you want to duplicate processing to change some params, like choosing "
"another AI mapping model for the same AOI - use Duplicate"
msgstr "如果您想重复处理以更改某些参数，例如为同一 AOI 选择另一个 AI 映射模型 - 使用 Duplicate"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:460 1291b6840cc24dda9a6c895783cba2fe
msgid "7.1 Download GeoJSON"
msgstr "7.1 下载 GeoJSON"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:462 470375d7043a4ca9b95fa46022ddde92
msgid "Allows to download results as a file in GeoJSON format."
msgstr "允许将结果下载为 GeoJSON 格式的文件。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:465 a982b3426383432e88801e47bb895833
msgid ""
"This option is not available in the free plan. Only paying users (see "
"`pricing <https://mapflow.ai/pricing>`_) can use this option."
msgstr "免费计划中不提供此选项。只有付费用户（请参阅“定价 <https://mapflow.ai/pricing>”_）可以使用此选项。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:491 133116ee0f9a4c5e9e7d655dcbef47bf
msgid "Working with API"
msgstr "使用 API"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:493 ec0f76423d524d50836f34ac16f25742
msgid ""
"Mapflow provides a REST API which, for example, allows you to query for "
"currently running flows and fetch the results. If you are developing an "
"application and want to use our API, - check out "
":doc:`../api/processing_api`."
msgstr ""
"Mapflow 提供 REST API，例如，允许您查询当前正在运行的流程并获取结果。如果您正在开发应用程序并想要使用我们的 API，请查看 "
":doc:`../api/processing_api`。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst:497 ccb55bd1805a45c9ba6fedc27f93c272
msgid ""
"You must follow the requirements specified with :ref:`Model_requirements` "
"when uploading your own images for processing through the API of the Mapflow"
" platform. Send a request using data preprocessing to help@geoalert.io."
msgstr ""
"通过 Mapflow 平台的 API 上传您自己的图像进行处理时，您必须遵循 Model_requirements "
"指定的要求。使用数据预处理将请求发送至help@geoalert.io。"

#: ../userguides/get_started.rst ac167f2676e34f56b41355536536d857
msgid "Preview map"
msgstr "预览地图"
